[
    {
        "content": "<p>I just landed this in <code>main</code>, so it can be used now</p>",
        "id": 614445193,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1785811865
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I haven't updated any builtins to actually use it yet though...I'm not sure if we want to go with names like <code>Parseable</code>, <code>Hashable</code>, <code>Equatable</code>, as opposed to something like <code>Parse</code>, <code>Hash</code>, <code>Eq</code>, etc. <span aria-label=\"thinking\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f914\" role=\"img\" title=\"thinking\">:thinking:</span></p>",
        "id": 614445232,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1785811895
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>should probably start a discussion in <a class=\"stream\" data-stream-id=\"304641\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/304641-ideas\">#ideas</a> at some point, but for now it's unblocked to use it in your type signatures <span aria-label=\"smile\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f604\" role=\"img\" title=\"smile\">:smile:</span></p>",
        "id": 614445277,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1785811932
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>and they're just aliases, so no harm if later builtins add them</p>",
        "id": 614445290,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1785811939
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm so excited about this feature, even though it's only aliases <span aria-label=\"octopus\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f419\" role=\"img\" title=\"octopus\">:octopus:</span> <span aria-label=\"octopus\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f419\" role=\"img\" title=\"octopus\">:octopus:</span> Particularly in the documentation, where I could see it as being a really useful entry point and description for an api, through which you can click to jump to the requisite functions.</p>",
        "id": 614479474,
        "sender_full_name": "Jonathan",
        "timestamp": 1785829845
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(Tbh the parser api hasn't quite clicked for me yet also, is there a talk/discussion of it in one of the recent roc meetups?)</p>",
        "id": 614479776,
        "sender_full_name": "Jonathan",
        "timestamp": 1785829952
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"477725\">Jasper Woudenberg</span> has marked this topic as resolved.</p>",
        "id": 614526608,
        "sender_full_name": "Notification Bot",
        "timestamp": 1785846545
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"281383\">Richard Feldman</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/383402-API-design/topic/.E2.9C.94.20Idea.20for.20alternative.20.60parser_for.60.20type.20signature/near/614445193\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just landed this in <code>main</code>, so it can be used now</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>how do you import a where alias from another module ?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"roc\"><pre><span></span><code># Foo.roc\n\nFoo := [] {\n    a.Stringable : where [a.to_str : a -&gt; Str]\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"roc\"><pre><span></span><code>import Foo exposing [Stringable]\n\nstringify : v -&gt; Str where [v.Stringable]\nstringify = |value| value.to_str()\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 614960247,
        "sender_full_name": "Romain Lepert",
        "timestamp": 1786014193
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Here is a working example <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"680911\">@Romain Lepert</span> </p>\n<p>Ifc.roc:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">Ifc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[].{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">a.Stringable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">a.to_str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Encodable</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">fmt</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nv\">a.encode</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">fmt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">U8</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Use.roc:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Ifc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">exposing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">Stringable</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Encodable</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">Use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">::</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[].{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># imported alias, unqualified</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">stringify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Stringable</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">stringify</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">to_str</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># imported alias, module-qualified — also fine</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">shout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Ifc</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Stringable</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">shout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">to_str</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># imported alias composed into a locally declared one</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">a.Loud</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Stringable</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">a.shout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\"># parameterized imported alias</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">enc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">fmt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">U8</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">where</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Encodable</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">fmt</span><span class=\"p\">)]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nv\">enc</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">f</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">value</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">encode</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">f</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 615242889,
        "sender_full_name": "Anton",
        "timestamp": 1786119884
    }
]